# Model weights are FETCHED, never committed.
#
#   python3 scripts/models/fetch_weights.py
#
# This directory is what workers/ml-runtime loads from (ModelCatalog.weights_dir),
# so it has to exist on a fresh clone -- hence this file, which is the only thing
# in here git tracks. The stack is 190MB+ today and would be gigabytes with SigLIP 2;
# provenance lives in the BLAKE3 pin in models/configs/*.json, not in git history.
#
# `.staging-*` is where the fetcher writes partial downloads before verifying them.
# A leftover one means a run was killed mid-download; deleting it is always safe.
*
!.gitignore
